  "bodyHash": "73fd1d0f890d6432",
  "content": "\n\nPlease provide the text you would like me to translate.\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<img title=\"Friends&amp;Foes\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/logo.png\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes\" width=\"836\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<center>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=请我喝杯咖啡&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"请我喝杯咖啡\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=成为赞助者&color=5b9c51&labelColor=5b9c51&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=patreon\" alt=\"成为赞助者\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=ffffff&label=加入我们的 Discord&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"加入我们的 Discord\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a style=\"text-decoration: none;\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=维基&logoColor=ffffff&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&labelColor=5b9c51&color=5b9c51\" alt=\"维基\">\n\t</a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\tFriends&amp;Foes 添加了在生物投票中落选或被遗忘的生物。主要目标之一是进一步扩展原始概念，并为所有生物添加新的原版风格特性。\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t你可以查看 <a title=\"wiki\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\">维基</a> 以获取已实现生物和特性的详细概览。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Crab\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab.gif\" alt=\"Crab\" width=\"60\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>螃蟹</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t介绍 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab\">螃蟹</a>，一种在红树林沼泽和海滩上游荡的友好生物。\n\t想要扩大你的攻击范围吗？蟹钳可用于制作一种增加你攻击范围的药水，为你的冒险提供宝贵的优势。\n\t如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab#breeding\">繁殖</a> 这个小家伙，你需要海带和耐心，因为螃蟹需要将卵“埋”在安全的地方。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"挥动蟹钳的螃蟹\" title=\"挥动蟹钳的螃蟹\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"攀爬红树林的螃蟹\" title=\"攀爬红树林的螃蟹\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与螃蟹相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Craw-Claw\">蟹钳</a> 物品</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Reaching\">延长攻击范围</a> 状态效果</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Tuff Golem\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem.gif\" alt=\"Tuff Golem\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>凝灰岩傀儡</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem\">凝灰岩傀儡</a>，一种外形威严的生物，可以手持并展示你交给它的任何物品，但请注意，当它不睡觉时，它喜欢随意散步。\n\t想让凝灰岩傀儡留在原地吗？用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#glueing\">蜂巢</a> 把它粘住。如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#creation\">建造</a> 这个沉睡的美人，需要收集一个凝灰岩石块、任意 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#dyeing\">颜色</a> 的羊毛方块和一个南瓜。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"手持附魔书的凝灰岩傀儡\" title=\"手持附魔书的凝灰岩傀儡\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"正在睡觉的凝灰岩傀儡\" title=\"正在睡觉的凝灰岩傀儡\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Rascal\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal.gif\" alt=\"Rascal\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>捣蛋鬼</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t发现 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Rascal\">捣蛋鬼</a>，一种生活在矿洞中的调皮小生物，喜欢在捉迷藏游戏中寻找乐趣。\n\t它既顽皮又乐于助人，在你寻找时会给你提示。\n\t找到它三次，它就会奖励你梦寐以求的收纳袋！\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"矿洞中的捣蛋鬼\" title=\"矿洞中的捣蛋鬼\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"捣蛋鬼抛出收纳袋\" title=\"捣蛋鬼抛出收纳袋\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Copper Golem\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem.gif\" alt=\"Copper Golem\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>铜傀儡</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t遇见 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem\">铜傀儡</a>，一种迷你而充满喜剧色彩的神奇生物，喜欢随机按下铜按钮。\n\t与其他铜制造物一样，它会随时间 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#oxidization\">氧化</a>，但别担心，维护起来非常简单！想要快速翻新，拿起 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#scraping\">斧头</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#waxing\">蜂巢</a> 即可。\n\t如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#creation\">建造</a> 这个小家伙，需要收集一个铜块、一个南瓜和一个避雷针。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"村庄中的铜傀儡工作台结构\" title=\"村庄中的铜傀儡工作台结构\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"铜傀儡\" title=\"铜傀儡\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与铜傀儡相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem-Workstation\">铜傀儡工作台</a> 村庄结构</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Button\">铜按钮</a> 的所有铜阶段变体</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Lightning-Rod\">避雷针</a> 的所有铜阶段变体</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img style=\"height: 40px; margin-bottom: 0px;\" title=\"Glare\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare.webp\" alt=\"Glare\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>瞪眼怪</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t介绍 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare\">瞪眼怪</a>，一种居住在繁茂洞穴中、性格暴躁却十分可爱的苔藓伙伴，它非常讨厌黑暗。\n\t你也讨厌黑暗吗？如果是这样，瞪眼怪可以为你标出那些足够怪物生成的黑暗区域。\n\t如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#taming\">驯服</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#breeding\">繁殖</a> 这只小家伙，你需要发光浆果，但请注意，瞪眼怪经常把它们当零食吃，不会留下残渣。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"幼年与成年瞪眼怪\" title=\"幼年与成年瞪眼怪\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"繁茂洞穴中飞翔的瞪眼怪\" title=\"繁茂洞穴中飞翔的瞪眼怪\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Iceologer\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer.webp\" alt=\"Iceologer\" width=\"25\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>冰术师</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t遭遇 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer\">冰术师</a>，一位居住在深雪之中的孤独灾厄村民。\n\t你可以在树林中寻找一间小型云杉木 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\">小屋</a> 来找到他。\n\t但在冒险时要小心，多年的野外生活让他的心比周围的冰雪还要冰冷。如果他发现了你，请准备好迎接 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\">冰霜攻击</a>，这将使你的冒险变成一场寒冰考验。\n</p>\t\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"雪地中的冰术师小屋\" title=\"雪地中的冰术师小屋\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"冰术师攻击村民\" title=\"冰术师攻击村民\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与冰术师相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\">冰术师小屋</a> 结构</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Freezing\">冰冻图腾</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Moobloom\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom.webp\" alt=\"Moobloom\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>花牛</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t\t介绍 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Moobloom\">花牛</a>，一种沐浴在阳光下、身披美丽花朵的奶牛，主要生活在鲜花森林中。\n\t\t这些被花朵覆盖的伙伴不仅赏心悦目，还能与蜜蜂产生和谐的协同效应。\n\t\t当它们穿行时，花牛会留下一串盛开的植物轨迹，将每一步都变成穿越自然奇观的迷人旅程。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"金盏花花牛\" title=\"金盏花花牛\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"繁花花牛\" title=\"繁花花牛\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与花牛相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Buttercup\">金盏花</a> 花朵</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beehives\">蜂箱</a> 的所有木质变体</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper-Area\">养蜂人区域</a> 村庄结构</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\">养蜂人</a> 村民职业</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Wildfire\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire.webp\" alt=\"Wildfire\" width=\"50\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>野火</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire\">野火</a>，烈焰人的主宰，受到四面盾牌的庇护。\n\t这次遭遇战并不友好，请注意躲避它的盾牌碎片弹幕和震地冲击波攻击。\n\t被逼入绝境时，它会召唤烈焰人作为援军。在你的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\">堡垒</a> 领地里征服这场挑战，用策略对抗这位火焰哨兵吧。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"下界中的堡垒结构\" title=\"下界中的堡垒结构\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"堡垒中的野火\" title=\"堡垒中的野火\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与野火相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\">堡垒</a> 结构</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown\">野火皇冠</a> 物品</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown-Fragment\">野火皇冠碎片</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Mauler (The Great Hunger)\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler.webp\" alt=\"Mauler\" width=\"40\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>吞噬者（大饥饿）</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t介绍 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)\">吞噬者</a>，一种在草原、恶地和荒漠中游荡的小型掠食者。它们正在追捕鸡、兔子等生物。\n\t你可以喂它们附魔食物来 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)#storing-and-extracting-experience-points\">储存经验值</a>，之后再用瓶子提取。但要注意，储存的经验值越多，吞噬者就会变得越大、越饿！\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"吞噬者追捕鸡\" title=\"吞噬者追捕鸡\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\"  alt=\"喂食后的吞噬者\" title=\"喂食后的吞噬者\" title=\"喂食后的吞噬者\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Illusioner\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner.webp\" alt=\"Illusioner\" width=\"25\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>幻影师</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t遭遇 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner\">幻影师</a>，一位居住在针叶林中、手持弓箭的狡诈骗子。你可以通过寻找一间小木屋或其训练场来找到他。\n\t请谨慎靠近，因为 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#casting-blindness\">致盲法术</a> 可能会让你陷入黑暗，使得分辨 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#summoning-illusions\">幻象</a> 与现实变得困难重重。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"针叶林中的幻影师小屋\" title=\"针叶林中的幻影师小屋\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"训练场中的幻影师\" title=\"训练场中的幻影师\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t与幻影师相关的其他特性：\n</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner-Shack\">幻影师小屋</a> 结构</li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Illusion\">幻影图腾</a> 物品</li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>\n\t<img title=\"Zombie Horse (Trap)\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse.webp\" alt=\"Zombie Horse (Trap)\" width=\"50\">\n\t<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n\t<span>僵尸马（陷阱）</span>\n</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t曾经想过骑乘 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Zombie-Horse-(Trap)\">僵尸马</a> 吗？如果是的话，在雷雨交加时靠近它，魔法或许就会发生——你甚至可能一睹四骑士的真容。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_1.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_1.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"雷雨中的僵尸马\" title=\"雷雨中的僵尸马\">\n\t</a>\n\t<a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_2.webp\" style=\"text-decoration: none;\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_2.webp\" width=\"49.4%\" alt=\"雷雨中的四骑士\" title=\"雷雨中的四骑士\">\n\t</a>\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>⚙️ 兼容性 / 附加模组</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\tFriends&amp;Foes 旨在与其他所有模组完全兼容，目前提供少量附加模组和数据包：\n</p>\n\n<ul style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms-fabric\">Friends&amp;Foes - 繁花花牛</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-fabric\">Friends&amp;Foes - 养蜂人小屋</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\">Repurposed Structures - Friends and Foes 兼容数据包</a></li>\n\t<li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/datapack/ctov-friends-and-foes-compat\">CTOV - Friends and Foes 兼容数据包</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>💬 社区</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t欢迎 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\">加入我们的 Discord 社区</a> 进行聊天、分享你的作品、提问，或仅仅是获取模组的最新开发动态并在新版本发布时收到通知。\n\t也请随时通过 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/issues\">GitHub Issues 报告任何崩溃或错误</a>。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>👋 支持</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t我会继续将模组开发作为爱好，因为我真心享受这个过程。如果你希望支持我，可以在 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\">Patreon</a> 或 <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/faboslav\">Ko-fi</a> 上赞助。非常感谢你的支持。\n</p>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<h1>📜 许可证</h1>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t本模组采用 <a href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/LICENSE.txt\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a> 许可证。\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t欢迎浏览我的代码，了解我在开发此模组时如何应对和解决各种挑战。你可以自由地将代码片段融入你自己的项目中。也欢迎在任何整合包中使用本模组（尽管若能注明出处/链接回本页面将不胜感激）。\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\n\t你也可以查看 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/blockbench\">blockbench 目录</a>（包含所有模型与调色板）以及 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/friendsandfoes/textures\">textures 目录</a>（包含纹理）。欢迎从中获取灵感，但请勿直接复制粘贴并据为己有。\n</p>",
